#=GF CC   This entry represents the second domain of class-I adenylate
#=GF CC   cyclases. It is composed of alpha-helices. Adenylate cyclase is
#=GF CC   the enzyme responsible for the synthesis of cAMP from ATP. On
#=GF CC   the basis of sequence similarity, it has been proposed that
#=GF CC   there are three different classes of adenylate cyclases [1, 2].
#=GF CC   Class I cyclases are found in enterobacteria and related
#=GF CC   Gram-negative bacteria.
